  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/08/ComisionFiestasAlcudiaDeVeo.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(10 fotos) Alcudia de Veo ha iniciado la noche de este viernes sus fiestas patronales, que se desarrollar&aacute;n hasta el domingo 13 de agosto. Cena de sobaquillo y actuaci&oacute;n del d&uacute;o Eslava han sido los primeros actos de un variado programa preparado por la comisi&oacute;n de fiestas.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/alcudiadeveo2017sopardesobaquillo/img_0427.jpg\" alt=\"img_0427\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/alcudiadeveo2017sopardesobaquillo/img_0428.jpg\" alt=\"img_0428\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/alcudiadeveo2017sopardesobaquillo/img_0432.jpg\" alt=\"img_0432\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/alcudiadeveo2017sopardesobaquillo/img_0436.jpg\" alt=\"img_0436\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/alcudiadeveo2017sopardesobaquillo/img_0437.jpg\" alt=\"img_0437\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/alcudiadeveo2017sopardesobaquillo/img_0440.jpg\" alt=\"img_0440\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/alcudiadeveo2017sopardesobaquillo/img_0442.jpg\" alt=\"img_0442\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/alcudiadeveo2017sopardesobaquillo/img_0444.jpg\" alt=\"img_0444\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/alcudiade